    skos:definition 'Term used to group wetland habitat types, specified by the Ramsar Convention\'s Classification for Wetland Type, approved by Recommendation 4.7 and amended by Resolutions VI.5 and VII.11 of the Conference of the Contracting Parties.'@en ;
